block hash/signed height fields. Keep the exact readable text and existing
IBD VALIDATION/Debug versus non-IBD Info branch. Header processing, hash
algorithms, validity, locking and selection are unchanged. Formatting moves
to the consumer and disabled Debug no longer preformats this message.

Use a dedicated conservative AST tool because the literal converter must
keep refusing an unproven %s alias. Require the exact pure initializer,
three msg identifiers, adjacent declaration/conditional at function scope,
original branch/category/severity, raw hash/index declarations, existing
cs_main assertion and no parse errors. Reject partial/drifted conversions;
verify idempotence. Two positive controls and18 negative mutations pass;
the unchanged literal converter still refuses the alias. Whole-source AST
matches the reviewed rewrite after clang-format. No general alias expansion,
custom regex source edits, new producer/renderer API or metadata keys.

Add a walletless actual-node fixture mining two regtest blocks. It checks
both IBD Debug and later Info records against RPC block hashes, heights,
categories and exact messages. Shared eCash header owner, unchanged chain
format assumptions. Source lint/Ruff/tool guards pass; producer remains
NOT_COMPILED and functional fixture NOT_RUN. Sealed381 intake unchanged.

